      "body": "✍️ 背枯燥八股文背到头晕？\n\n📚 文档翻到眼花却还是记不住？\n\n😩 面试准备到底能不能有点意思！\n\n播面 App 让你听懂面试八股文，先别枯燥的八股文，一款专门为面试准备的播客App/网站\n\n**让你通勤路上戴上耳朵闭眼也能准备面试（巴适~**\n\n**甚至上班戴上耳机就能“偷偷”准备面试（滑稽～**\n\n**还支持将小红书、牛客网、公众号的面经导入并生成答案**\n\n（其中 App 中的暖色模式还是用的阮老师网站的暖色，因为每次看都觉得好舒服 哈哈哈哈\n\n网页版：[https://www.bomianfm.com](https://www.bomianfm.com/)\n\n<img width=\"3024\" height=\"1648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/59bda76d-128d-46a9-8964-0c29878263a0\" />\n\nios 版本：[播面](https://apps.apple.com/cn/app/%E6%92%AD%E9%9D%A2/id6751013403)\n\n<img width=\"360\" height=\"2532\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2c612302-542f-4382-835c-96839f0a8b85\" />\n<img width=\"360\" height=\"2532\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/400e8764-2d11-4598-83a3-914afcbfa66e\" />\n<img width=\"360\" height=\"2532\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f4aaa0cf-e08a-4ecd-85da-bf1ef517d878\" />\n\n<img width=\"360\" height=\"2532\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3e7912a3-d119-43dd-834f-115bd3e243a3\" />\n<img width=\"360\" height=\"2532\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3ba4a560-3b99-4a53-8e27-0fa2a1eaa094\" />\n<img width=\"360\" height=\"2532\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fece3dc1-dfa7-4965-a465-e824f051c017\" />\n\n<img width=\"360\" height=\"2532\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/07083880-a11e-40df-82df-9dc3ea9720c2\" />",
